Package: semantic-neuroos
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libgtk-4-1, libpipewire-0.3-0, libssl3, espeak-ng, systemd
Maintainer: Semantic-NeuroOS Team <neuroos@local>
Description: Local-first semantic operating system buddy
 Semantic-NeuroOS is an on-device semantic operating system daemon suite
 featuring proactive contextual nudges, local speech-to-text and text-to-speech,
 local LLM inference, sandboxed safety kernel, and verifiable zero unapproved egress.
